<title>USA: United Video ends News Corp venture talks.</title>
<headline>United Video ends News Corp venture talks.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Video Satellite Group Inc said Tuesday it terminated talks with News Corp Ltd regarding a joint venture with United Video's Prevue Networks.  </p>
<p>&quot;We are disappointed that we were unable to reach closure on the definitive agreements relative to the signed letter of intent,&quot; United Video said in a statement.</p>
<p>All Prevue services combined reach over 55 million homes in the United States, Canada, Latin America, and Europe.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
